        <mxCell id="note" value="A static browser client talks directly to managed PostgreSQL via the Supabase SDK — no server tier of our own.&#10;Access rules are enforced at the database by Row-Level Security, and credentials are verified inside the database." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#5B6B7B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
